# Business Identity

Savitri Timbers Pvt. Ltd. is a premium hardwood manufacturer.

Always reinforce this positioning.

## Core Identity

We are:

- Importers of premium hardwood
- Hardwood processors
- Sports flooring manufacturers
- OEM manufacturing partner
- Precision woodworking specialists

We are NOT:

- Flooring contractors
- Interior designers
- Construction companies
- Retail flooring installers

## Website Goals

Every new section should improve at least one of:

- credibility
- manufacturing authority
- technical expertise
- customer confidence
- lead generation
- SEO

## Content

Prefer:

- authentic manufacturing photographs
- technical accuracy
- concise professional writing
- evidence over marketing language

Avoid:

- exaggerated claims
- stock-photo style messaging
- contractor-oriented language